url: https://github.com/fatedier/frp
version: v0.71.0
pkgrev: 1

Repack of the official static Go binary release (no rebuild):
  https://github.com/fatedier/frp/releases/download/<version>/frp_<version-no-v>_linux_arm_hf.tar.gz
sha256 verified at build time against frp_sha256_checksums.txt from the
same GitHub release. Bump `version:` to move upstream; bump `pkgrev:` for
packaging-only changes.
